right now with word of the day.

00:07:51.584 --> 00:07:55.543
- Scattertonic, it means that
when someone does a fart joke,

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.050
you just can't stop laughing.

00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:58.900
- I am into fart jokes.

00:07:58.900 --> 00:08:00.543
